---
import MainLayout from '../../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
import SpotlightImage from '../../components/SpotlightImage.astro';
---
<MainLayout 
  title="Content Marketing & Strategy Orange County CA | OCWebPros" 
  description="Content marketing and strategy for Orange County businesses. Topic clusters, strategic SEO articles, and content calendars that build topical authority and bring in qualified organic traffic."
  bodyClass="page-services page-content-marketing"
  pageCSS="/css/pages/services.css">

  <header class="relative pt-32 sm:pt-32 md:pt-40 pb-12 sm:pb-16 px-4 sm:px-6 text-center overflow-hidden">
    <div class="absolute top-0 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-[90vw] max-w-[800px] h-[400px] sm:h-[500px] md:h-[600px] glow-bg pointer-events-none opacity-40"></div>
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto relative">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-slate-100 border border-slate-200 text-xs font-medium text-orange-400 mb-6">
        <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-orange-500 animate-pulse"></span>
        Content Marketing
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-bold tracking-tight mb-4">
        Content Marketing &amp; Strategy for <span class="text-gradient-orange">Orange County</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="text-slate-600 text-lg leading-relaxed max-w-3xl mx-auto">
        We research the questions your customers actually ask, plan topic clusters around them, and publish strategic articles and service pages that build topical authority - so qualified organic traffic compounds month after month.
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center mt-8">
        <a href="/contact/" class="px-8 py-3.5 bg-orange-700 text-white font-semibold rounded-full hover:bg-orange-600 transition-colors btn-glow text-sm md:text-base">
          Request a Consult
        </a>
        <a href="/pricing/" class="px-8 py-3.5 bg-slate-100 text-slate-900 font-semibold rounded-full border border-slate-200 hover:bg-slate-100 transition-colors text-sm md:text-base">
          View Pricing
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main class="pb-16 sm:pb-24 px-4 sm:px-6 md:px-8">
    <!-- Spotlight -->
    <section class="max-w-7xl mx-auto pt-8 md:pt-12 pb-16 md:pb-24 px-4 sm:px-6">
      <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center gap-8 md:gap-12">
        <div class="w-full md:w-1/2 backdrop-blur-[12px] bg-slate-100 border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 md:p-10" data-aos="fade-right">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-slate-100 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-orange-500" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19.428 15.428a2 2 0 00-1.022-.547l-2.387-.477a6 6 0 00-3.86.517l-.318.158a6 6 0 01-3.86.517L6.05 15.21a2 2 0 00-1.806.547M8 4h8l-1 1v5.172a2 2 0 00.586 1.414l5 5c1.26 1.26.367 3.414-1.415 3.414H4.828c-1.782 0-2.674-2.154-1.414-3.414l5-5A2 2 0 009 10.172V5L8 4z"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-4 text-slate-900">Content That Compounds</h2>
          <p class="text-slate-600 mb-6 text-lg leading-relaxed">Random blog posts don't build rankings - connected content does. Every article we write belongs to a topic cluster with a clear target keyword, a job to do, and internal links that strengthen your whole site. That's how topical authority gets built, and it's what Google and AI search reward.</p>
          <ul class="space-y-3 text-slate-700">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="mt-1 w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-orange-500 flex-shrink-0"></span><span>Keyword and question research from real Orange County search data</span></li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="mt-1 w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-orange-500 flex-shrink-0"></span><span>Topic clusters that establish your business as the local authority</span></li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="mt-1 w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-orange-500 flex-shrink-0"></span><span>Articles written for readers first - then structured for search and AI Overviews</span></li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="mt-1 w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-orange-500 flex-shrink-0"></span><span>Published, interlinked, and tracked - so you see what each piece earns</span></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <SpotlightImage
          src="/images/unsplash/support-team.jpg"
          alt="Content team planning an editorial calendar together"
        />
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- What We Deliver -->
    <section class="max-w-7xl mx-auto pt-2 md:pt-4 pb-16 md:pb-24 px-4 sm:px-6 md:px-8">
      <div class="text-center mb-12" data-aos="fade-up">
        <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold mb-2 text-slate-900">What Content Marketing Includes</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm md:text-base max-w-2xl mx-auto">From research through publishing and measurement - content marketing is included on our Growth and Dominance plans, with 2-4 strategic articles per month.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        <div data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="0">
          <div class="w-8 h-8 flex items-center justify-center mb-3">
            <svg class="w-8 h-8 text-orange-500" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M8 7V3m8 4V3m-9 8h10M5 21h14a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 002 2z"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">Editorial Calendar</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">A rolling content plan mapped to keyword opportunities and seasonality - so you always know what's publishing next and why it matters.</p>
        </div>
        <div data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="100">
          <div class="w-8 h-8 flex items-center justify-center mb-3">
            <svg class="w-8 h-8 text-orange-500" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 20l-5.447-2.724A1 1 0 013 16.382V5.618a1 1 0 011.447-.894L9 7m0 13l6-3m-6 3V7m6 10l4.553 2.276A1 1 0 0021 18.382V7.618a1 1 0 00-.553-.894L15 4m0 13V4m0 0L9 7"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">Topic Cluster Strategy</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">Pillar pages surrounded by supporting articles, all interlinked - the structure Google uses to decide who's the authority on a topic.</p>
        </div>
        <div data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="200">
          <div class="w-8 h-8 flex items-center justify-center mb-3">
            <svg class="w-8 h-8 text-orange-500" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M11 5H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v11a2 2 0 002 2h11a2 2 0 002-2v-5m-1.414-9.414a2 2 0 112.828 2.828L11.828 15H9v-2.828l8.586-8.586z"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">SEO Article Writing</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">Strategic articles that answer real customer questions with local Orange County context - written to rank, cite, and convert.</p>
        </div>
        <div data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="300">
          <div class="w-8 h-8 flex items-center justify-center mb-3">
            <svg class="w-8 h-8 text-orange-500" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12h6m-6 4h6m2 5H7a2 2 0 01-2-2V5a2 2 0 012-2h5.586a1 1 0 01.707.293l5.414 5.414a1 1 0 01.293.707V19a2 2 0 01-2 2z"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">Service Page Content</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">Dedicated pages for every service and city you serve - the pages that turn commercial-intent searches into calls and form fills.</p>
        </div>
        <div data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="400">
          <div class="w-8 h-8 flex items-center justify-center mb-3">
            <svg class="w-8 h-8 text-orange-500" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M4 4v5h.582m15.356 2A8.001 8.001 0 004.582 9m0 0H9m11 11v-5h-.581m0 0a8.003 8.003 0 01-15.357-2m15.357 2H15"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">Content Refreshes</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">Aging posts updated with current data, expanded coverage, and new internal links - often the fastest ranking win on an established site.</p>
        </div>
        <div data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="500">
          <div class="w-8 h-8 flex items-center justify-center mb-3">
            <svg class="w-8 h-8 text-orange-500" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 7h8m0 0v8m0-8l-8 8-4-4-6 6"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">Performance Tracking</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">Every piece is tracked for rankings, traffic, and conversions - winners get expanded, underperformers get reworked.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Process -->
    <section class="max-w-7xl mx-auto py-16 md:py-24 px-4 sm:px-6 md:px-8 bg-slate-50 border-y border-slate-100">
      <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold mb-12 text-center" data-aos="fade-up">Our Content Process</h2>
      <div class="hidden md:flex items-center justify-between relative">
        <div class="absolute top-6 left-0 right-0 h-0.5 bg-orange-500/30 -z-10"></div>
        <div class="flex flex-col items-center flex-1 relative group" data-aos="zoom-in" data-aos-delay="0">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-slate-50 border-2 border-orange-500 text-orange-400 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg mb-4 relative z-10 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">1</div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2 text-center group-hover:text-orange-400 transition-colors">Research</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 text-center max-w-[180px]">Keyword data, customer questions, and competitor gaps.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-col items-center flex-1 relative group" data-aos="zoom-in" data-aos-delay="150">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-slate-50 border-2 border-orange-500 text-orange-400 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg mb-4 relative z-10 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">2</div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2 text-center group-hover:text-orange-400 transition-colors">Plan</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 text-center max-w-[180px]">Topic clusters, briefs, and an editorial calendar.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-col items-center flex-1 relative group" data-aos="zoom-in" data-aos-delay="300">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-slate-50 border-2 border-orange-500 text-orange-400 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg mb-4 relative z-10 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">3</div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2 text-center group-hover:text-orange-400 transition-colors">Publish</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 text-center max-w-[180px]">Written, edited, interlinked, and shipped on schedule.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-col items-center flex-1 relative group" data-aos="zoom-in" data-aos-delay="450">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-slate-50 border-2 border-orange-500 text-orange-400 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg mb-4 relative z-10 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">4</div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2 text-center group-hover:text-orange-400 transition-colors">Improve</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 text-center max-w-[180px]">Track performance, refresh winners, rework the rest.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="md:hidden space-y-8">
        <div class="flex gap-4 relative">
          <div class="flex flex-col items-center">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-slate-50 border-2 border-orange-500 text-orange-400 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg">1</div>
            <div class="w-0.5 h-full bg-orange-500/30 mt-2 absolute top-12 left-6"></div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex-1 pt-2">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">Research</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">Keyword data, customer questions, and competitor gaps.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex gap-4 relative">
          <div class="flex flex-col items-center">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-slate-50 border-2 border-orange-500 text-orange-400 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg">2</div>
            <div class="w-0.5 h-full bg-orange-500/30 mt-2 absolute top-12 left-6"></div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex-1 pt-2">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">Plan</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">Topic clusters, briefs, and an editorial calendar.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex gap-4 relative">
          <div class="flex flex-col items-center">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-slate-50 border-2 border-orange-500 text-orange-400 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg">3</div>
            <div class="w-0.5 h-full bg-orange-500/30 mt-2 absolute top-12 left-6"></div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex-1 pt-2">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">Publish</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">Written, edited, interlinked, and shipped on schedule.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex gap-4">
          <div class="flex flex-col items-center">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-slate-50 border-2 border-orange-500 text-orange-400 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg">4</div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex-1 pt-2">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">Improve</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">Track performance, refresh winners, rework the rest.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Related -->
    <section class="max-w-7xl mx-auto py-16 md:py-24 px-4 sm:px-6 md:px-8">
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
        <div class="backdrop-blur-[12px] bg-slate-100 border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8" data-aos="fade-up">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">The Strategy Behind the Content</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">Content marketing starts with SEO strategy - keyword research, competitor gap analysis, and intent mapping decide what gets written before a word goes on the page.</p>
          <a href="/services/seo-strategy/" class="text-sm text-orange-400 font-medium hover:text-orange-300 transition-colors inline-flex items-center gap-1">
            Explore SEO strategy
            <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7"></path></svg>
          </a>
        </div>
        <div class="backdrop-blur-[12px] bg-slate-100 border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="100">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">Optimize What You Already Have</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">New content works best alongside optimized existing pages. Our on-page SEO service tunes your current titles, headings, links, and copy for maximum impact.</p>
          <a href="/services/on-page-seo/" class="text-sm text-orange-400 font-medium hover:text-orange-300 transition-colors inline-flex items-center gap-1">
            Explore on-page SEO
            <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7"></path></svg>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- CTA -->
    <div class="text-center py-12 sm:py-16 md:py-24 px-4 sm:px-6 md:px-8" data-aos="fade-up">
      <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold mb-4 text-slate-900">Ready to build content that actually ranks?</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-600 mb-8 max-w-xl mx-auto">Request a consult and we'll map the content opportunities in your market - the questions your customers are asking that nobody is answering yet.</p>
      <div class="inline-flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4">
        <a href="/contact/" class="px-10 py-5 bg-orange-700 text-white font-bold rounded-full hover:bg-orange-600 transition-colors text-lg btn-glow">
          Request a consult
        </a>
        <a href="/pricing/" class="px-10 py-5 bg-slate-100 text-slate-900 font-bold rounded-full border border-slate-200 hover:bg-slate-100 transition-colors text-lg">
          View all pricing
        </a>
      </div>
      <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm mt-3">Prefer a call? Add your number in the email.</p>
    </div>
  </main>
</MainLayout>
